Import smart_open only in the targets that use it

smart_open is needed only by SmartOpenTarget (S3, GCS); Moonraker uses
the file, value and SHA256 targets. Importing it lazily avoids packaging
smart_open and its dependencies for the AD5X image.

Upstream: not submitted (AD5X open OS)

